   "phrasing": "greet_01"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm great, thanks.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.68,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_08"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I have a phone screening tomorrow. Is it different from a normal interview?",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 0.25,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "It's usually shorter and more about checking the basics, like your experience, availability and salary range.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.4,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Can I have notes in front of me?",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 0.9,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Yes, that's one of the perks. Just don't read them out word for word, it's easy to hear.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.84,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Should I stand or sit?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 3.42,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Some people find standing makes their voice more energetic. Smiling while you talk also comes through in your tone.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.73,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I always feel weird talking to a stranger",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 0.71,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg17"
  },
  {
